        <mxCell id="2Det45" parent="1" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=11;fontColor=#5C4110;fontStyle=0;" value="&lt;font color=&#x27;#5C4110&#x27;&gt;&lt;b&gt;PROTOCOLS AND SECURITY&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;REST / JSON + JWT&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Browser to FastAPI (through the Vite server in development). Every request carries a JWT token; the API reads the user and the role from SQLite before it answers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Passwords&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Stored as Argon2 hashes in the users table. Tokens expire after 60 minutes.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Background task&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;FastAPI to the orchestrator, in the same process. No network hop.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;HTTPS + API key&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Agents to Groq. Keys and tokens are removed from everything saved.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Local HTTP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;To Ollama for the embeddings. They never leave the host.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;OTLP&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Traces to Phoenix, when it is configured.&lt;/font&gt;" vertex="1">
          <mxGeometry height="404" width="304" x="78" y="786" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
      </root>
    </mxGraphModel>
  </diagram>
</mxfile>
